<h1>Brambleforce</h1>
<p class="muted">Run-and-gun through a killer garden. A Neon Tombstone game from Useful Appz.</p>

<div class="card">
  <h2>$6.99 — the full game, zero ads</h2>
  <p>The Crownless Court is growing over the world, and Dr. Sylvan Crowe's machines are doing the gardening. You're the Vinebreakers — the crew that prunes back.</p>
  <p>10 missions in two views — side-scroll assaults and top-down canopy sweeps. Four fighters who genuinely play differently. Eleven bosses — and Mother Orchid, who roams, hunts you, and cannot be killed. Damage only slows her down. The correct play is to run.</p>
  <p>Built for controllers (gamepad supported out of the box), keyboard, and touch. Fully voiced banter. Extra lives are earned, never sold.</p>
  <h3>How it works</h3>
  <ol>
    <li>Buy here with PayPal ($6.99).</li>
    <li>Download the Android APK from your purchase page (the link is emailed too).</li>
    <li>Open it — allow installs from this source if asked — and tap Install.</li>
  </ol>
  <p><a class="btn" href="/brambleforce/buy/game">Get Brambleforce — $6.99</a></p>
  <p class="muted fineprint">Android 8+. This is the direct sideload edition — no Play Store needed. Optional extras below are bought right here and unlocked in the game with a code.</p>
</div>

<h2>Optional extras</h2>
<p class="muted">All cosmetic or content — never difficulty. Lives and continues are never sold. Ever. Bought extras unlock with a single-use code: open Brambleforce → EXTRAS (B) → REDEEM CODE.</p>
<div class="grid">
  <% productIds.filter(function (id) { return id !== 'game'; }).forEach(function (id) { var p = products[id]; %>
  <article class="card" style="padding:1rem;">
    <h3 style="margin-top:0;"><%= p.name %></h3>
    <p class="muted" style="margin:.25rem 0;"><%= p.blurb %></p>
    <p><a class="btn" href="/brambleforce/buy/<%= id %>">Buy — $<%= (p.priceCents / 100).toFixed(2) %></a></p>
  </article>
  <% }); %>
</div>

